{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act14side_level_act14side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act14side",
  "stageId": "act14side_05",
  "title": "獵場",
  "storyCode": "BI-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act14side/level_act14side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bc9bbcc966e977d0fa0ae29fe9b08283ee326a192a82ed2406d2d028d3458470",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下來的行動準備好了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "諾希斯大人......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我可以問一個問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真少見，這是不是你頭一次提出問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......屬下僭越。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是，若按照我們的計畫行事，事後追查起來，布朗陶家恐怕也將受到牽連。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "屬下......屬下只是擔心，如今諾希斯大人與布朗陶家結成同盟，若是布朗陶家遭發難，是否會對諾希斯大人的計畫不利......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說的問題我也考慮過，不過無妨，布朗陶家如何從來不是重點，這次機會十分難得，我不希望錯過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我也希望你能保全自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果真的出現最壞的情況，不需要考慮布朗陶家的問題。我瞭解恩希歐迪斯，只要你的證詞對他有利，他大概暫時不會動你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到時我會安排人手確保你的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "諾希斯大人！我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你有顧慮，計畫也可以換人執行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不！請讓我來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要是諾希斯大人的吩咐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莫希在所不辭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的謝拉格戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這下總算是把那些野獸全部解決了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的謝拉格戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有一兩個小子受了點傷，但沒什麼大礙......多虧了聖女大人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我並沒有做什麼。是各位出色地證明了自己的勇武，想必耶拉岡德也會為祂的勇士們自豪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年長的謝拉格戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您、您過獎了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年輕的謝拉格戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聖女大人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？你是......剛剛的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年輕的謝拉格戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我。多謝聖女大人方才救了我一命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聖女大人！您剛剛確實是太冒險了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但還是感謝您，感謝您救了這個混小子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#11$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "耶拉岡德的子民之間本就應當如此，不必言謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年輕的謝拉格戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......聖女大人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "確實是精彩的一箭。我還不曾聽聞聖女大人竟還有這樣的本領......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聖女原本就應有保護雪山民眾的能力，這並不是什麼值得特別提及的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您就是太謙虛了！方才的那一箭，我看完全能與我們謝拉格最善射的戰士比個高下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聖女大人！阿克托斯大人，菈塔托絲大人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不、不好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "亂喊什麼？我們好得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是希瓦艾什家的人？怎麼，又出什麼事了，總不會是你們也遭到野獸襲擊，他恩希歐迪斯還要來找外援吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不、不是野獸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那究竟是怎麼回事，不要吞吞吐吐，快說清楚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是！是恩希歐迪斯大人遭刺客襲擊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_253_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_253_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩希歐迪斯他被襲擊？竟有人敢在聖獵這樣的場合對他動手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......留下一半人手保護聖女，保持警惕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其餘的人，跟著我走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，阿克托斯！你發什麼瘋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要幹什麼，難道你真要去救援？且不說恩希歐迪斯他需不需要，就現在的情況......你想清楚了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......沒什麼好想的，菈塔托絲，我知道你的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我，我不管他恩希歐迪斯如何，他是真心悔改也好，假意做戲也罷，有人要在聖獵作怪，我阿克托斯絕不允許！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——我族世代立有保護謝拉格的誓言，聖獵儀式的秩序也在此之列！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真是莽夫......罷了，我倒是要看看，你這好心能換來什麼結果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerToken": "avg_174_slbell_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩希歐迪斯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩希歐迪斯大人！血......您受傷了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無妨，不要驚慌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是您的傷......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小傷罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很出色的隱匿技巧，出其不意......沒想到竟會有人在聖獵中動手，確實是我大意了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼，不出來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然有膽量挑這種場合動手，便是對耶拉岡德的大不敬之舉，應當早有覺悟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼，難道沒有想過嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不必用這種方法激我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我既然敢動手，當然早想過後果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩希歐迪斯，今天我走不出這片獵場，你也休想能夠安然離開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看來你的決心不假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用你說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "恩希歐迪斯，你裝作虔誠，實則對耶拉岡德沒有半點敬畏之心，你對謝拉格造成的傷害大家都看在眼裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣的說法倒是很少當面聽到人說。眼下的謝拉格，會對我敵意如此之大的人並不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "會有這樣的指責，若不是被觸及了利益，就是真正虔誠的極端信者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
