      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "少妨礙我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很遺憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些忽然發狂的野獸也是提前準備好的吧？聖獵中，我隨行的護衛不多，若他們都被絆住手腳，這確實會是個難得的好機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但......看來你的機會到此為止了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你這是在小看我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫希",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你已經被我傷到，就算你再怎麼輕描淡寫，也沒法瞞過我！"
