    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你確實是耶拉岡德最虔誠的信徒，阿克托斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過，恐怕你來遲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這是什麼意思？你恩希歐迪斯沒道理會放走區區一個刺客，人到底被你藏哪裡去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，這片懸崖......難道？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就是你想的那樣，阿克托斯。我的部下會去搜索對方的蹤跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "繼續狩獵吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "地上有血，你受傷了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小傷而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerToken": "avg_199_yak_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老爺，你的傷得立刻處理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerToken": "avg_199_yak_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至少......至少要先止血！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "繼續狩獵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "耶拉岡德的祭典，不應因我個人緣故而有任何閃失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerToken": "avg_199_yak_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希歐迪斯",
      "speakerToken": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "通知其他人，一切照常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerToken": "avg_199_yak_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在眾人矚目之下，希瓦艾什家年輕的主人邁開腳步。\n風雪縈繞在其周身，又在其頷首仰頭間四散，未有任何一冊經卷曾記載這樣一種身姿。\n斑駁的赤色在他身後由深到淡，最後歸為純白的印記，融入山川。\n無人敢攔，無人可阻。\n恩希歐迪斯向前走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
